# Colourings

Do not add a new colouring method in this repository. Add it in MetaMetro and open a pull request there.

Do not mock a colouring. Tests may parse a tiny FASTQ or classifier file in that tool's format. They must not invent colour masks.

Check that a selected colouring is compatible with the MetaMetro build: the namespace must exist on the ToCUMG.

Use MetaMetro colourings and `filter_colours` / `load_bench_graph(..., namespaces=...)` to keep the layers this tool needs.
